WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:07.000
The mountains were quiet that winter.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.500
I promised I would find you, no matter how far.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Every road I walked led me further from home.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Do you remember the songs our grandmother sang?

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Stay close. The storm is coming.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:14.000
Some stories are carried, not told.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.500
We are stronger together than we ever were apart.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
This is only the beginning.
